  "answer_text": "Azure VPNs use different default IPsec settings (including PFS/DH groups) than other cloud vendors. If the Azure defaults don’t match the Cato site, the tunnel can come up but fail at rekey due to a DH/PFS mismatch. Ensure the DH group you configure in the Cato IPsec site matches what Azure expects and align the IKEv2/IKEv1 phase 2 parameters on both sides.",
